    "B_theme": {
      "name": "B_theme",
      "bars": 8,
      "notes": "The principal statement, and the clearest one in the piece. The lead states the motif in beats 0-7.5 using the motif's own rhythmic proportions, then rests; the dizi answers with the identical rhythmic shape in beats 8-15.5. Strict antiphony, twice. Both chords span 4 bars so that every chord contains pattern onsets - with a shorter third chord the engine fills the empty span with repeated notes and the antiphony collapses.",
