    "C_ornament": {
      "name": "C_ornament",
      "bars": 9,
      "notes": "Variation by decoration - jiahua, 'adding flowers'. The lead switches to dragon_flower: the same arch with neighbour tones inserted between the structural pitches, so the skeleton is still audible under a denser surface. Dizi and erhu both move to sustained long tones over it, which is the Jiangnan sizhu layering.",
      "progression": [
        "I5",
        "IV5",
